<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">EMORL-TTS: Reinforcement Learning 
<br class="ltx_break">for Fine-Grained Emotion Control in LLM-based TTS</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="id1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center"><span id="id1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Haoxun Li<sup id="id1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>  Yu Liu<sup id="id1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>  Yuqing Sun<sup id="id1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>  Hanlei Shi<sup id="id1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>  Leyuan Qu<sup id="id1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1</span></sup>  Taihao Li<sup id="id1.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id1.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">⋆,1</span></sup></span></span></span>
</span>
</span>
</span><span id="id2" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_correspondence ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span><sup id="id2.1" class="ltx_sup">⋆</sup> Corresponding authors.</span></span></span><span id="id3" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_note ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>Haoxun Li, et al. Copyright 2026 IEEE. Personal use of this material is permitted.
Permission from IEEE must be obtained for all other uses, including reprinting/republishing,
